    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Smart Animal</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Micrograv Transhuman Habitats</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1–6</p><p>Favored by some uplifted octopi as pets (and by others as snacks), squidlings are .25-meter-long squid adapted for air breathing, their natural water jet locomotion replaced by powerful jets of air for micrograv propulsion. Most lack ink sacs, these being a hazard in space habitats.They aren’t exactly affectionate, but they instinctively shoal with octomorphs for protection and will eagerly devour any scraps dropped to them.</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Small Size (−10 to hit)</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Enhanced Smell</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 5 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 1, Death Rating 8.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 162.</em></p>",
